<p>The only exceptions, I think, are when the information itself poses such a severe hazard that no one can be allowed to risk exposure, when the intelligence value to the Foundation is low but the risk is high (identities of the O5 for example), or when someone has sabotaged the documents in order to hide information from the rest of the Foundation.</p>

